<Layout title="Privacy · HQD Aggregate catalogue"><section class="container page-heading"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Privacy</p><h1>Privacy<span>.</span></h1></section><article class="container prose"><h2>Browser-local product selection</h2><p>The shortlist is saved in this browser’s local storage. It is not connected to an account and is not uploaded by this catalogue. Use “Clear shortlist” to remove the saved selection.</p><h2>Enquiry drafts</h2><p>The contact form prepares a mailto link locally. It does not submit form information to a website backend. Your email application receives the draft only when you choose “Open email draft”; you review and send it yourself.</p><h2>Images and external links</h2><p>Product images are served with this website. HQD source links open the original manufacturer website. External websites and email providers have their own privacy practices. This catalogue does not add advertising or analytics trackers.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For product enquiries, contact <a href="mailto:lisa@hqd-spindlemotor.com">lisa@hqd-spindlemotor.com</a>.</p></article></Layout>
